WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:01,510
Your Majesty

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:06,870
Mu Ying, the son of Duke Qian, asked to see him outside the palace and let him in.

3
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:11,460
Chen Muying, please get up after seeing your majesty.

4
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:17,050
Why do you come to me this noon? Your Majesty, please come.

5
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:19,330
This is a request for Fang Yang, the son of Duke Bi.

6
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:22,450
Are you begging me for my family?

7
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:25,270
Interesting

8
00:00:25,790 --> 00:00:27,070
Aren’t you two at odds with each other?

9
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:29,980
Why did you ask His Majesty to beg for him?

10
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:31,660
I beg for Fang Yang

11
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:33,090
Quan Yinchen feels

12
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:34,250
What he said is right

13
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:37,630
Three religions and nine tours of the Panfu tribe

14
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:39,070
They are all chefs and common people

15
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,320
This young master is a noble queen

16
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:42,720
Enjoy the country’s grace from generation to generation

17
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:44,840
We should protect the chefs and common people

18
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:49,420
Thank you for your help.

19
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:52,060
I will naturally protect the people who are chefs

20
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:55,380
I will release this Fang Yang. Thank you, Your Majesty.
